{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45526","headline":"题楚庙 · 归仁","name":"题楚庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羞容难更返江东，谁问从来百战功。\n天地有心归道德，山河无力爲英雄。\n芦花尚认霜戈白，海日犹思火阵红。\n也是男儿成败事，不须惆怅对西风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}